  "body": "What if everything you love about Milford was right on your doorstep?\r\n\r\nBeach. Boats. Coffee. Shopping. Parks. Home. All within minutes.\r\n\r\nThis is the kind of Milford living people wait for - easy, beautifully renovated and close enough to the beach that you can listen to it from bed.\r\n\r\nWith genuine motivation behind the sale, our vendors are ready to engage with the market.\r\n\r\nSingle-level living keeps life simple, while generous proportions, excellent storage and sun-filled spaces make it feel anything but compromised.\r\n\r\nThe home has been thoughtfully renovated with an open-plan layout, a modern kitchen with integrated appliances, two generous bedrooms, one bathroom and double glazing for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nOutside, east and west courtyards let you follow the sun throughout the day - perfect for morning coffee, afternoon drinks or simply enjoying a little more time outdoors.\r\n\r\nAdd off-street parking for two, covered parking, a separate laundry and the ease of a true lock-and-leave lifestyle, and this is a home that makes everyday living feel effortless.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thurs 29th October from 5pm at Ray White Milford (unless sold prior)\r\nINFO: rwmilford.co.nz/MFD30632 (scroll down to documents)\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n- Brick and tile construction\r\n- Beautifully renovated, single-level living\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\n- Renovated kitchen with integrated fridge\r\n- Large semi-ensuite bathroom\r\n- Sun-drenched east & west courtyards\r\n- Double glazed \r\n- Excellent proportions + plenty of storage\r\n- Large wardrobes with custom storage\r\n- Separate laundry\r\n- Off-street parking for two\r\n- Covered carport/garage\r\n\r\nAnd then there's Milford itself.\r\n\r\nThe beach, reserve, cruising club, marina, Milford Mall, cafes and everyday essentials are all just moments away, with excellent school zoning including Milford School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar and dual Westlake.\r\n\r\nSingle level. Lock and leave. Milford at your feet.\r\n\r\nEverything you need is here.\r\n\r\nWelcome home.",
